OL,3,GNEWSARepublic of Ireland net migration
OL,4,Acontinues to fall from Ukraine war peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FNet migration to the Republic of
OL,7,FIreland has continued to decline from
OL,8,Fits Ukraine war peak, new figures
OL,9,Fsuggest.
OL,11,FAn estimated 111,000 people came to
OL,12,Flive in the country in the year to
OL,13,FApril, while 62,500 people left meaning
OL,14,Fthere was net immigration of
OL,15,Fapproximately 48,000 people.
OL,17,FThat compares to net immigration of
OL,18,Falmost 60,000 in 2025 and almost 80,000
OL,19,Fin both 2023 and 2024.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
