OL,3,GNEWSARepublic of Ireland net migration
OL,4,Acontinues to fall from Ukraine war peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FImmigration became a major social and
OL,7,Fpolitical issue in Ireland after the
OL,8,Fcountry accepted a large number of
OL,9,FUkrainian refugees alongside an
OL,10,Fincrease in other sources of
OL,11,Fimmigration.
